      "content": "i dont even know why i'm still doing this. it feels like i've been holding my breath for years and i'm just... so tired. everything is just grey now. i look at him and it's like i'm looking at a ghost, and i feel like a ghost too. just waiting for the end to finally come so the silence can actually be real.",
