      "content": "therapy doesnt change the fact that it's just this... endless cycle of watching someone fade away while i fade away too. it feels so futile. like i'm just a witness to something that’s already over. Sometimes i look at him and i just wish we could both just... stop. just find some actual peace and be done with the struggle. it feels like the only real relief would be if everything just went quiet for good.",
